{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2023-05-03 11:30:00', 'title': "AIR PRODUCTS' CHAIRMAN, PRESIDENT AND CEO TO SPEAK AT GOLDMAN SACHS INDUSTRIALS AND MATERIALS CONFERENCE ON MAY 10", 'text': 'LEHIGH VALLEY, PA. , MAY 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AIR PRODUCTS TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CHAIRMAN, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER SEIFI GHASEMI \xa0WILL SPEAK\xa0AT THE GOLDMAN SACHS INDUSTRIALS AND MATERIALS CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, MAY 10, 2023 AT 8:00 A.M.'}